# geist-watch scene manifest
# The five-minute door rule at its threshold. Sampling every 10 s keeps
# evidence inside the 15 s gap; the event is due at 302 s (confirmed open
# at 2 s) and lands at the first tick after that.
version 1
scene door-dev
split dev
camera cam-hall
match_window 30000

rule front-door sustained yes 2 2000 15000 300000

truth front-door door_open_sustained 302000

sample 0 - front-door=yes
